150
00:10:04.573 --> 00:10:13.107
150k req per second; 1 to 3 rules evaluated each, then up to ~450k rule checks per second.

151
00:10:13.387 --> 00:10:21.600
Active keys: ~5M customers per day + devices + IPs + partners + phones about 10M keys.

152
00:10:21.880 --> 00:10:23.117
