268
00:17:29.613 --> 00:17:31.256
Token leasing (adaptive).

269
00:17:31.536 --> 00:17:33.413
In-contract requests rejected:

270
00:17:33.693 --> 00:17:34.440
0.

271
00:17:34.720 --> 00:17:36.213
