321
00:21:23.207 --> 00:21:24.722
The limiter's store will fail.

322
00:21:25.002 --> 00:21:27.349
Decide the behaviour per rule, in advance.

323
00:21:27.629 --> 00:21:32.322
L4 took the OTP limiter's Redis down for 2 minutes during an attack:

