656
00:49:30.099 --> 00:49:36.969
The dominant cost in L3 is SMS, not infrastructure: a limiter design is also a fraud budget.

657
00:49:37.249 --> 00:49:42.177
Report attack spend avoided alongside infrastructure cost (Ch 35).

